{"work":"tipitaka","version":"sc-pli","book":"an1","chapter":209,"title":"16. Tatiyavagga","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"“Etadaggaṁ, bhikkhave, mama sāvakānaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ sikkhākāmānaṁ yadidaṁ rāhulo."},
{"v":"2","t":"… Saddhāpabbajitānaṁ yadidaṁ raṭṭhapālo."},
{"v":"3","t":"… Paṭhamaṁ salākaṁ gaṇhantānaṁ yadidaṁ kuṇḍadhāno."},
{"v":"4","t":"… Paṭibhānavantānaṁ yadidaṁ vaṅgīso."},
{"v":"5","t":"… Samantapāsādikānaṁ yadidaṁ upaseno vaṅgantaputto."},
{"v":"6","t":"… Senāsanapaññāpakānaṁ yadidaṁ dabbo mallaputto."},
{"v":"7","t":"… devatānaṁ piyamanāpānaṁ yadidaṁ pilindavaccho."},
{"v":"8","t":"… Khippābhiññānaṁ yadidaṁ bāhiyo dārucīriyo."},
{"v":"9","t":"… Cittakathikānaṁ yadidaṁ kumārakassapo."},
{"v":"10","t":"… Paṭisambhidāpattānaṁ yadidaṁ mahākoṭṭhito”ti. Vaggo tatiyo."}
]}
